%% Q-Calculus: an ordered, typed derivation with one query root per query-mode
%% course, or one independent structural/status root in its corresponding mode.
%% Step validation is atomic at the environment boundary: an illegal rule,
%% missing certificate, or inconsistent terminal prevents the entire normative
%% derivation from being emitted.
